{"campaign_version":"storage-taxonomy-v2-20260813","canonical":{"bri_country":"Yes","category":"光伏","country":"泰国","country_iso":"THA","created_at":"2026-04-10T09:06:29.532008","excluded":0,"excluded_reason":null,"id":"THA-PV-0021","ldc":"No","location":"泰国东北部边境的诗琳通大坝","location_norm":null,"name_en_quality":"ai_translated","project_name":"泰国诗琳通大坝58.5MW浮体光伏项目","project_name_en":"Thailand Sirindhorn Dam 58.5MW Floating Solar Project","subcategory":null},"events":[{"articles":[{"author":"","content":"12月16日，中国能建规划设计集团山西院收到泰\n国电力公司（EGAT）\n的中标通知书，确认\n山西院与泰国B.Grimm公司组成的联合体\n成功中标泰国EGAT诗琳通大坝浮体光伏项目。\nEGAT诗琳通大坝浮体光伏项目是泰国目前\n最大的浮体光伏项目\n,也是泰国最大的水电+光伏+储能的综合能源\n现汇项目\n。项目规划容量58.5兆瓦，位于泰国东北部边境的诗琳通大坝，距曼谷约655公里。\n本项目是山西院与泰国EGAT的首个合作项目，也是山西院被确定为中国能建泰国市场开发主体单位后中标的关键项目，项目的实施对于持续拓展泰国能源市场、提升中国能建品牌形象具有重要意义。","content_sha256":"a0c499e8e107a7f9ff2c62862c2940f4eda106086a6f6a98fb291ad236705eff","id":22373,"publish_date":"2019-12-18 11:45:21","title":"中国能建联合体中标泰国最大水面浮体光伏项目","title_sha256":"1147fb21a1f0a90570d6576ad3a138027fa73afa84a928e27cdb367c4c52754c","url":"https://news.goalfore.cn/topstories/detail/12433.html"}],"event":{"additional_remarks":"","canonical_id":"THA-PV-0021","capacity_details":"PV: 58.5MW","capacity_mw":58.5,"capacity_mw_raw":"58.5","capacity_source":"legacy","contract_amount_usd":null,"contract_amount_usd_raw":null,"created_at":"2026-04-10T09:06:29.538200","financing_amount_usd":null,"financing_amount_usd_raw":null,"financing_model":"Unknown","financing_model_details":"","id":"THA-PV-0021-01","investment_date":"","line_length_km":null,"needs_manual_review":0,"non_official_website_links":"[]","official_website_links":"[\"https://www.ceec.net.cn/art/2021/9/16/art_11016_2514695.html\"]","planned_complete_date":"","planned_start_date":"","production_capacity_unit":null,"production_capacity_value":null,"project_developer":"泰国电力管理局; B.Grimm","project_developer_en":"Electricity Generating Authority of Thailand (EGAT); B.Grimm","project_stage":"中标","project_summary":"中国能建规划设计集团山西院与泰国